        "purpose": "Defaults of hosted notebook nodes (Colab/Kaggle). notebook_runtime.sh exports assist_default_env=1 unless the caller set it; pyctl/assist/assist_settings.py then treats the listed capabilities as enabled while the user has no stored assist_laravel section (a stored value always wins), so the node assists the Laravel queue (audio lanes, translation) immediately. tts_engines: per platform, the only neural TTS engines installed (in every accelerator mode) and kept in the pinned tts_runtime_plan chains (notebook_runtime.sh, pyutils/tts/runtime_profile.py); a platform without a row installs the engines of the active plan mode.",
